Please read the latest post to the Lojban Blog:
http://community.livejournal.com/lojban/15886.html

It concerns a proposal to grant official sanction to my Lojban art
element alongside the existing symbol for Lojban. We on the Logical
Language Group Board of Directors want to measure the support of the
community. I am going to set up a web poll and post the URL to it
soon. Until then, please look at the discussion of the plan and its
reasons, which is accompanied by several pieces of art.

